     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\nDear all,</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\nfor those of you who haven&#39;t heard yet: Olivier Gimenez is writing a book on hidden Markov models using software Nimble. Much of what we do in population analysis as on this list can be cast as an HMM and Nimble code is extremely similar to JAGS. Hence, this\r\n book will be very relevant to the work of many on this list.</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\nPlease check it out here: <a href=\"https://oliviergimenez.github.io/banana-book/index.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://oliviergimenez.github.io/banana-book/index.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792493460577000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2X36ZEDEL90kaWsuDLQSHY\">\r\nhttps://oliviergimenez.github.io/banana-book/index.html</a></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\r\nBest regards  -- Marc<br>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
